{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/8676","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/8676/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/8676/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/8676/events","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/8676","id":155088402,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxNTUwODg0MDI=","number":8676,"title":"JitEmitterVisitor producing incorrect arguments","user":{"login":"jfromme","id":11460646,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDYwNjQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11460646?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfromme","html_url":"https://github.com/jfromme","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfromme/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfromme/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfromme/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfromme/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfromme/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfromme/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfromme/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfromme/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfromme/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":130606843,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzA2MDY4NDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/type:%20bug/fix","name":"type: bug/fix","color":"EEEEEE","default":false,"description":null},{"id":375501288,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzU1MDEyODg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/area:%20core","name":"area: core","color":"c7def8","default":false,"description":"Issues related to the framework runtime"}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2016-05-16T18:19:51Z","updated_at":"2019-09-12T03:21:26Z","closed_at":"2017-07-19T17:20:07Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I have situation where code generated by angular is trying to call ngOnInit on an injectable service which does not have this method.\n\nI believe the problem is caused by JitEmitterVisitor.visitExternalExpr() producing duplicate names for two different arguments at the line:\n\n`this._evalArgNames.push(sanitizeIdentifier(`jit_${name}${id}`));`\n\nI have a component which is given the name class11 and the service has the name class1. There is a function evaluation where the component is the 4th arg visited (id = 3) and the service is the 14th. (id = 13). So both args end up with the name jit_class113. Then getArgs() overwrites the component with the service and the wrong object is passed during evaluation.\n\nMaybe the fix is to add a separator between the name and the id?\n\n`this._evalArgNames.push(sanitizeIdentifier(`jit_${name}_${id}`));`\n\nI don't know if it's a coincidence, but running in production mode seems to fix the problem.\n","closed_by":{"login":"chuckjaz","id":372013,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjAxMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372013?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz","html_url":"https://github.com/chuckjaz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/8676/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/8676/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}